Select GPU
Which GPU should Chrome render and decode video on? One image serves both; this sets the box's passthrough.
setup,create
param|CHROME_GPU
AMD / Intel|amd|Mesa via the default /dev/dri passthrough, no host prerequisite (default)
NVIDIA (CDI)|nvidia|Adds --device nvidia.com/gpu=all + NVIDIA EGL; needs /etc/cdi/nvidia.yaml
